<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Orthologic upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Orthologic upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc said it upgraded its rating on OrthoLogic Corp to buy from neutral in an intraday move based on valuation.</p>
<p>--Rodman initiated coverage of the orthopedic medical device company on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Its EPS estimates are for earnings of $0.27 in 1996. In 1995, the company reported a loss of $0.09 per share.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
